  "notes": [
    "Stops have two ids: the public 5-digit stopCode (on signs and sfmta.com URLs) and the internal GTFS stopId, which is the code without the leading 1. find-stop maps a code to its internal id.",
    "Route ids are the route short names as shown on vehicles (e.g. 22, 38R, N, KT); use list-routes to discover them.",
    "Real-time times are Unix timestamps (seconds in GTFS trip updates, milliseconds in umoiq predictions and vehicles); delay values are in seconds."
